@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Melihat Format Surat Izin Siswa (Tata Usaha)

actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary "UI" as UI
control "Controller" as C
entity "Database" as DB

== Akses Template Surat Izin ==
TU -> UI: 1. Akses menu "Presensi Siswa" > "Template Surat Izin"
UI -> C: 2. Request template surat izin
C -> DB: 3. Get letter template data
DB --> C: 4. Return template format
C --> UI: 5. Load template page
UI --> TU: 6. Tampilkan format surat izin siswa

@enduml